    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f9bf649a-3f72-5302-b1a9-64969e082f78" activityNameId="2dc64a14-4204-56b7-904b-8195d2816236" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Mine, gravel/sand</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Mine, gravel/sand
Data are estimated based on an air-picture for one mine and sketches of the process. The average yearly production volume per unit (mine) is about 400'000 to 500'000 t/a and the life time is assumed to be 50 years;
Synonyms: pit, Grube; 
UUID: a9c36a33-e835-3a39-b142-901efd37e076
includes the area of the infrastructure (buildings, paved roads, etc.) and the machines used for the gravel mining, does not include the area of the actual mine, which is included in mining
Location: The data are based on the investigation on 4 representative Swiss gravel pits; for some exchanges RER modules have been used as proxy
Technology: average Swiss gravel/sand mine
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Measured data of four Swiss plants 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a9c36a33-e835-3a39-b142-901efd37e076.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
